<title>USA: AGTsports reduces debt by $172,000.</title>
<headline>AGTsports reduces debt by $172,000.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGTsports Inc said Monday it had reduced its debt by $172,500 in a stock restructure with London-based Global Links Trading.</p>
<p>In a statement, AGT said that in an amendment to its 1995 joint venture agreement with Global, Global canceled $172,500 of AGT debt and converted 6.85 million shares of AGT common into one million shares of non-voting AGT preferred stock.</p>
<p>The 6.85 million shares of AGT common represent 23 percent of the total issued and outstanding shares of AGT, the company said.</p>
<p>AGTsports is a sports technology company with emphasis on the golf industry.</p>
